WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,500
Citizens of Lianbang, you have seen

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,220
Not even the Valkyrie can cut her down

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,280
The Zerg are not here to destroy us.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:13,320
As long as one of them hands over the medicine and medicine to her and dismantles the Mecha Zerg, they will retreat.

5
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,640
Is it true that peace is just around the corner?

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,000
The war can be stopped by handing over one person

7
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,040
I don't want to pay any more war taxes

8
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,880
My son is only three years old

9
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,360
Thirty years older

10
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,810
It turns out that I only need to pay one person

11
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,010
hand over stored medicine

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:29,450
hand over stored medicine

13
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:30,850
Look at the top of your head

14
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,730
That's not something we can defeat

15
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:36,650
It's Zhou Jingxing who is asking you to die

16
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,050
hand over stored medicine

17
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,650
Dismantle Taiwei Beichen

18
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:41,290
Peace is at hand

19
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:42,410
want peace

20
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:44,250
Zhou Jingxing steps down

21
00:00:45,090 --> 00:01:01,740
If I want to leave, I can go to Dr. Heping Gu instead.

22
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,660
Tomorrow he wants Tianxucheng, do you want to hand it over?

23
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:09,660
If he wants your daughter the day after tomorrow, kneel down and send her over.

24
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:12,500
Li Weitong is still hanging in the sky

25
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:14,820
You say this is called for peace

26
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,740
Told you the queen wanted to negotiate

27
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:22,580
Anyone who asked me first said no.
